#28500
"Scales of Justice"
"The room you're standing in seems large and small at the same time, as if its
dimensions operate under different rules than the rest of the world.  The
walls, ceiling, and floor are all a shimmering silver.  Reflections cast from
these borders are distorted visions of the reality around you.  The room is
devoid of any objects, the sole exception a set of scales on a raised dais in
the room's center.  There are open archways in each basic cardinal direction,
although you cannot seem to see beyond them.
"
"[DW] Up is a blank room that we'll list our area ides in.
[Semix] Tenative: level^4 penalty for getting caught
[Semix] need rextra for the archways.

Type \"push button\" to spawn a Val'Abun Pamphlet (temporary) to get an idea
of what this place is all about.
"
