#28501
"Central Bazaar"
"The enormous marbled road continues to the north, west, and south.  To the east
is a building raised above the rest of the bazaar, with a long set of wide,
silvery steps surrounding it.  There is an open archway to the building, but
you can't quite see what's past it.  The clank of metal on metal is faint, but
distinct, and stems from farther north.
"
"[Semix] Need rextra for the archway
"
