#28505
"Central Bazaar, Northwest Corner"
"Rhythmic clanging emerges from the shop to the west, and although there is no
marking to signify what type of store it is, you can make out racks of various
weapons lining the walls.  To the north is a similar clamor, although you can
detect that it has a slightly different tone.  You cannot quite make out what is
inside that shop, however.  The wide, white-marbled road continues to the south
and east.  A building that sits at the center of the bazaar looms to the
southeast.
"
""
