#28523
"Outer Bazaar, Northwest Corner"
"The west end of the domed structure that is the Val'Abun Coliseum lies to the
north, its apex many stories high.  There are several dozen entryways to the
north, accessible in between the multitude of Doric columns that support this
amazing stonework construction.  The sound of music can be heard sporadically
coming from the west, where a shop with a golden guitar, depicted on a sign to
the right of its door, stands.  The white-marbled road continues along the
outer bazaar to the south and east.
"
"[DW] Shouts and cheers reverberate from the colesium to the north. (acode)
"
