#28538
"Outer Bazaar, Northeast Corner"
"The sand-colored temple before you seems to pulse with an energy more felt than
seen, raising goose bumps all over your body.  Six steps lead north into the
temple, its doorway shrouded in the total darkness of a moonless night.  To the
east is the edge of a another, more sinister temple whose entrance is farther
south.  A glowing light can be seen further west, its source a distant spire in
the sky.
