#28550
"Y.T's Inn"
"The \"inn\" provides a service where the client is put into a state of suspended
animation through immersion in a pool of an emerald-glowing liquid.  The liquid
cleanses the body of impurities and increases the natural regenerative powers
of the subject.  The pool also has the property that time moves much faster for
the subject than those not immersed, effectively creating a near-instant
recovery.
"
"The owner of this inn will fully restore you for 20 plat with a suspended
animation-type sleep.  since the entire zone is no.recall, this should be
relatively non-abusable.
