#28563
"Government District Crossroads"
"Rivers of white marble form an immense intersection here, the entrance to
Val'Abun's bazaar.  The roads are easily wide enough for twenty horse-drawn
carts to ride down, side by side.  A cornucopia of sights, sounds, and smells
assault your senses, hinting at the wide variety of goods and services
available here.  To the north is a throughway that will bring you to the
center of the bazaar, while the roads east and west seem to go in between
shops along the outer bazaar walls.  Far to the south you can make out a huge
set of adamantine gates that mark the entrance to the Government District.
"
