#28590
"Emerald District Crossroads"
"Water pours out of a vertical spout at the top, flowing down into a small
basin about three feet below.  The water then falls about a foot down into a
slightly bigger basin, then another two feet into a much larger one.  Finally,
the water drops three more feet into the giant base of the @efountain@n, rippling
gently, reflected the pristine emerald color of the entire construction.
"
""
